    <code code="51848-0" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Evaluation note"/>
    <title>Assessment</title>
    <text><list><item>Chronic cough with wheeze and breathlessness since his late thirties, worse every winter and within a day of any stay in the city or by an open fire, better in warm weather and country air; night cough two or three times a week this winter; under evaluation: active, confirmed [S]</item><item>Long exposure to urban air pollution (decades in a large city with heavy traffic and coal and wood burning) and to indoor solid-fuel smoke from open coal and wood fires at home: active, confirmed [S]</item></list></text>

  </section>
